# NOT excluded, on purpose: test-support/.
#
# `test-support/demo-seed` is the e2e dataset, and compose.e2e.yml:22-26 seeds
# the e2e volume from the BUILD stage (`npm run seed:demo`) precisely because
# the build stage still has the full source tree — the final image deliberately
# does not. Adding `test-support` here would leave the image smaller and `npm
# run e2e` dead, with the failure surfacing as an empty board rather than a
# missing file. The demo data never reaches the shipped image regardless: the
# Dockerfile's final stage copies only what it names.
